      "text": "SEXUAL (seed)              ASEXUAL (clonal)\n  +------------------+       +------------------+\n  | Genetic variation|       | Identical to     |\n  | (meiosis mixes   |       | parent plant     |\n  |  alleles)        |       | (mitosis only)   |\n  | New combinations |       | Preserves variety|\n  | Dormancy systems |       | No dormancy in   |\n  | Long-term storage|       | most methods     |\n  | Slow to first    |       | Faster maturity  |\n  | fruiting         |       | in most cases    |\n  +------------------+       +------------------+\n        |                          |\n        v                          v\n  Annuals, vegetables,       Fruit trees, named\n  most field crops           cultivars, vegetative\n  (desirable: F1 vigor)      ornamentals, potatoes"
